A||N||26||AusFiero||My New Fiero||||6||
Z||000000||AusFiero||09-20-2001||04:55 AM||||Well the crisped 86 GT was turning out too expensive, too much hassle and just too too much to fix even though it only appears to be minor damage. So here is the new Fiero that will contribute to the cause by using this car and parts off my GT. The t-tops will go in this car along with my stereo, my 5 speed gearbox, fastback clip and different things. Oh my VIN number and such is also getting transefered to save compliance hassles and to keep it a GT once all my GT bits go on it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>The interior will also be getting upgraded along the lines of my old car and after talking to my mechanic who happens to be an ex Pontiac racing team employee we are going to rebuild the 2.8 and turbocharge it. He reckons he can get 300 hp out of it easily. Mind you we aren't talking a small budget to do that.<P>This car is an 86 SE with 36,000 miles on the clock. It has Koni adjustable shocks,  lowered springs, stabiliser bars front and rear, a power chip from Hypertech and ventilated disc brakes. Even though I am going to upgrade the brakes anyway.<P>So here it is. The easier project to do than a burnt car. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newfiero01.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newfiero02.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newfiero03.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newfiero04.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newfiero05.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||6
Z||000001||AusFiero||09-20-2001||05:37 AM||||hmmm now a guy that wouldn't get back to me before has gone and thrown a spanner in the works. This car or buy his 86 SE Bodied 4 cylinder auto Fiero and change everything to V6. The upside on the 4 cylinder. New paint, t-tops, and only $3500 US or $7000 local which is $4000 cheaper than the other car. <BR>Hmmmmmmm<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
