Z||000004||Denny||09-20-2001||07:48 AM||||Way to go, Aus! Nice find!<P>Now, if you don't mind a little advice, transfer the front crossmember from your GT while you're at it. It's a a much stronger piece than what's in the SE, reinforced at all the stress points. Not a real difficult job, either.<P>Enjoy!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 10-03-2001).]||||reg||10
