Z||000015||AusFiero||09-20-2001||06:41 PM||||To Pay to get a RHD conversion done usually runs in at about AU$5000 (US$2500). To do it yourself usually costs around AU$2000. Other cars cost more. For instance a late model Corvette, Firebird or Dodge Ram for instance can cost AU$15,000 to $20,000. <p>[This message has been edited by AusFiero (edited 09-20-2001).]||||reg||1
