Z||000020||MinnGreenGT||09-21-2001||05:02 PM||||I think that would be a blast!  As a matter of fact... at this time last year I was cruising around Scotland in a Vauxhall Omega (Caddilac Catera with a 4cyl Eco engine   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)- it would be more of a novelty here than anything else. Why do you question the question?<P>EDIT: BTW- I'm running an auto tranny... so I don't have to worry about shifting with my left hand  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 09-21-2001).]||||reg||1
