Z||000023||Boomtastic||09-24-2001||09:09 AM||||Aus,<P> Nice replacement, although she'll never be the same as the GT.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> My condolences. Can we see some more pics of the left-to-right hand conversion? Some things that I'm curious about are the placement of the e-brake, the brake booster is still on the left hand side (??), and how the dash finish work is. Right hand drive cars have always fascinated me, since they weren't factory done. If it weren't too much, I'd buy one and have it shipped here. Hmmm .. you offer free shipping, right?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||1
